// Script-mode project guard (one of two entry units): top-level
// statements synthesize a main in module mod_a.a. Together with
// mod_b/b.n the project has two synthesized entry points and must fail
// backend entry disambiguation ("entry point is ambiguous") — the two
// files live in different directories so the merged-namespace frontend
// (same-bare-pool duplicate check) stays out of the way.
int x = 1;
return 10 + x;
